<title>CANADA: Great-West issuer bid accepted by TSE, MSE.</title>
<headline>Great-West issuer bid accepted by TSE, MSE.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great-West Lifeco Inc said on Thursday a normal course issuer bid had been accepted by the Toronto and Montreal stock exchanges.</p>
<p>Great-West said they intend to buy up to, but not more than, 300,000 common shares of the corporation. The amount represents 0.38 percent of outstanding shares as of November 15, 1996.</p>
<p>The bid runs from on Dec 1, 1996 to Nov 30, 1997.</p>
<p>During the past year Great-West purchased 53,700 common shares at an average price of $30.18 each, the company said. Great-West Lifeco is a member of the Power Financial Corporation group of companies.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
